WEBVTT

00:00:59.811 --> 00:01:03.570
So I grew up hating lions so much.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:06.623
The morans are the warriors

00:01:06.623 --> 00:01:09.940
who protect our community and the livestock,

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:13.019
and they're also upset about this problem.

00:01:13.019 --> 00:01:16.024
So they kill the lions.

00:01:16.024 --> 00:01:19.938
It's one of the six lions which were killed in Nairobi.

00:01:19.938 --> 00:01:24.477
And I think this is why the Nairobi National Park lions are few.

00:01:24.477 --> 00:01:29.438
So a boy, from six to nine years old, in my community

00:01:29.438 --> 00:01:32.312
is responsible for his dad's cows,